,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740175572,"data":"Q: Meri gehun ki 2 acre zameen hai, poora plan banayein beej se bikri tak\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740216864,"data":"Jaldi karein! Meri beej se bikhari ko 2 acre zameen mein plan karne ke liye:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740223275,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740227191,"data":"1. Zameen ka size: 2 acres = 87,100 square feet (approximately)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740231578,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740235403,"data":"2. Beej se bikhari ka total area: 2 acres * 43,560 sq ft/acre = 87,120 sq ft\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740239616,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740244071,"data":"3. Total land required for one row of plants:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.74024832,"data":"   - Row width: 20-30 inches = 0.5 to 0.7 meters\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740252619,"data":"   - Number of rows per acre: 12-15 rows (depending on plant spacing)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740257415,"data":"   - Area per row: 0.5 m x 0.7 m = 0.35 sq m ≈ 3.5 sq ft\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740262066,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740265908,"data":"4. Number of rows needed:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740285104,"data":"   - For 87,120 sq ft: 87,120 / 3.5 ≈ 25,000 rows\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740288913,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740291886,"data":"5. Planting density:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740295022,"data":"   - Assume 10 plants per row\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.7402983,"data":"   - Total number of plants: 25,000 rows * 10 plants/row ≈ 250,000 plants\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":79.740301528,"data":"\n"}
