,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662823962,"data":"Q: Meri sarson me aphid lag gaya hai, kya karu?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662860153,"data":"Aphids can be quite annoying when they infest your garden or plants! Here are some steps you can take to deal with them:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662865914,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.66286945,"data":"1. Remove the aphids: Use your fingers or a soft brush to remove as many aphids as possible from your plant.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662873456,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.66287667,"data":"2. Spray with insecticidal soap: This will kill the aphids on contact and prevent them from laying eggs.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662880124,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662883229,"data":"3. Apply neem oil: Neem oil is an organic pesticide that works well against aphids and other pests.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662886786,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662890743,"data":"4. Introduce natural predators: Ladybugs, lacewings, and parasitic wasps are all beneficial insects that prey on aphids.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662894407,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662897681,"data":"5. Rotate crops: Aphids tend to build up in one area of your garden over time, so rotating your crops each year can help reduce their population.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662901551,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662904761,"data":"6. Use physical barriers: Covering your plants with row covers or netting can prevent aphids from getting access to your plants.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.66290847,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.66291186,"data":"Remember, prevention is key when it comes to aphid control. Regularly inspect your plants for signs of aphids and take action before they become a major problem.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":88.662915855,"data":"============================================================\n"}
