,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":99.681475604,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":99.681478995,"data":"2. AgriEasy ko online payment system (like Paytm, Google Pay, etc.) use karne ke liye login karein aur account create karein.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":99.68148275,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":99.681498024,"data":"3. AgriEasy ko offline payment system (cash, cheque, etc.) use karne ke liye bank account number, IFSC code, and other details provide karein.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":99.681502027,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":99.681505435,"data":"4. AgriEasy ko cheez jaldi dekhna chahiye, agar pahle nahi check karte ho, toh payment ka dhyan na rakhte hain.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":99.681510814,"data":"\n"}
